P-K3a: WF-FC: the dual is WF-FC (Hack)
P-K3b: WF-FC: extreme conservation rays = 0/1 indicators of minimal siphons
P-K3c: WF-FC: extreme flux rays = 0/1 indicators of minimal T-traps (minimal siphons of the dual)
P-K3d: WF-FC: ray MIPS = classes of species lying in the same minimal siphons
P-K3e: WF-FC: profile rule gives P(dual)
P-K3f: WF-FC: N and N* have no critical siphon
P-K3g: WF-FC: no twin pair conservation-coupled; P(dual)<=M iff JF; P(dual)=M fails if n>=2; P(dual)<=S iff JF
P-K3g': WF-FC: reaction side: no doubling pair fully coupled; P<=M(dual) iff CF; P=M(dual) fails if r>=2; P<=S(dual) iff CF
